
>> countries := 数组对象 新建
	~ ['Switzerland']
	~ ['Italy']
	~ ['Germany'].

>> foods := 数组对象 新建
	~ ['Rösti']
	~ ['Spaghetti']
	~ ['Sauerkraut'].


>> counter := 0.
foods 按: countries, 每个: { :key :value
	counter 加: 1.
}.

输出 写入: (['we serve counter dishes'] counter: counter), 停止.

>> counter := 42.
['TrytosortthiswithoutsegfaultingButActualNumberDe✎dsOnOS'] 字符 排序: { :v
	counter 加: 0.
}.

输出 写入: (['we sort counter dishes'] counter: counter), 停止.


>> counter := 0.
{
	{
		counter 加: 1.
	} × (3 + 1 + 1 × 0.5).
} × 100.


输出 写入: (['we calculate counter numbers.'] counter: counter), 停止.

